Worktree `D:\Projects\Camel-wt\h15g-entry`, branch `handover/H15g-entry-width` (from `develop`).
Everything is left in the working tree: no commit, no new branch, no push.

This is H15g, the two items of the H15f review (`docs/handover/reviews/H15-H20-H21.md`,
lines 84–91):

> 1. **`i32`/`f32` 入口参数按 `int64`/`double` 读**：`--arg n=3000000000` 给 `n: i32` 被读成
>    int64 后接受（或拒绝时说 `int`），`f32` 参数按 double 读。小项。
> 2. **`let x: int = '42'` 说的不对**：不做文本到数字的隐式转换（5.1）。现在的消息"文本不是数字"不对
